msgid "VerySleepy"
msgstr "An-Chodladh"

msgid ""
"Start the Godot editor or your project first. If you start the Project "
"Manager, make sure to edit or run a project first. Otherwise, the profiler "
"will not track the child process since the Project Manager will spawn a "
"child process for every project edited or run."
msgstr ""
"Tosaigh an t-eagarthóir Godot nó do thionscadal ar dtús. Má thosaíonn tú an "
"Bainisteoir Tionscadail, déan cinnte tionscadal a chur in eagar nó a "
"reáchtáil ar dtús. Seachas sin, ní dhéanfaidh an próifíleoir an próiseas "
"leanaí a rianú ós rud é go sceithfidh an Bainisteoir Tionscadail próiseas "
"leanaí do gach tionscadal a chuirtear in eagar nó a rithfear."

msgid "Click the **Profile All** button on the right to start profiling."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an gcnaipe **Profile All ** ar dheis chun próifíliú a thosú."

msgid ""
"Perform the actions you wish to profile in the editor or project. When "
"you're done, click **Stop** (*not* Abort)."
msgstr ""
"Déan na gníomhartha is mian leat a phróifíliú san eagarthóir nó sa "
"tionscadal. Nuair a bheidh tú déanta, cliceáil **Stop** (*not* Tobscoir)."

msgid "Wait for the results window to appear."
msgstr "Fan go mbeidh fuinneog na dtorthaí le feiceáil."

msgid ""
"Once the results window appears, filter the view to remove external modules "
"(such as the graphics driver). You can filter by module by finding a line "
"whose **Module** matches the Godot executable name, right-clicking that line "
"then choosing **Filter Module to <Godot executable name>** in the dropdown "
"that appears."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh an fhuinneog torthaí le feiceáil, scagaigí an t-amharc chun "
"modúil sheachtracha a bhaint (amhail an tiománaí grafaic). Is féidir leat "
"scagadh de réir modúil trí líne a aimsiú a mheaitseálann **Modúl** leis an "
"ainm inrite Godot, cliceáil ar dheis ar an líne sin agus roghnaigh **Modúl "
"Scagaire go <ainm inrite Godot>** sa roghchlár anuas a fheictear."

msgid "Your results window should now look something like this:"
msgstr "Ba chóir go mbeadh cuma éigin mar seo ar fhuinneog do thorthaí anois:"
